sequenceDiagram
  participant Agent as Parent Codex agent
  participant Bridge as t3_tasks dynamic tools
  participant Domain as T3 orchestration engine
  participant Provider as Provider command reactor
  participant Codex as Codex app-server
  participant Store as Event log and projections
  participant UI as Sidebar and thread view

  Agent->>Bridge: create bounded child task
  Bridge->>Domain: thread.task.create
  Domain->>Store: persist thread.created
  Store-->>UI: ordered thread-upserted push
  Bridge->>Domain: thread.turn.start
  Domain->>Provider: projected turn request
  Provider->>Codex: start normal provider session and turn
  Codex-->>Domain: provider runtime events
  Domain->>Store: persist normalized events
  Store-->>UI: ordered live updates
